  "substitution_note": "TIMER2 (timer.comp-genomics.org / compbio.cn) is blocked and not grantable. Substituted the GDC-hosted Thorsson et al. immune-landscape data products: methylation-based leukocyte fraction, ABSOLUTE DNA-based tumor purity, stromal fraction = 1 - purity - leukocyte fraction, and 24 of the published 160 PanImmune expression signature scores (TGF-beta, wound healing/core serum response, proliferation, angiogenesis, and immune cell abundance). This is the published source behind TCGA immune/stromal state, but it is NOT identical to TIMER2 output: no TIMER2 per-cell-type deconvolution estimates, and leukocyte/purity are DNA-based rather than expression-deconvolution-based. Per-sample immune subtype labels C1-C6 are NOT present in the GDC PanImmune file set (only the signature scores that define them); the mclust subtype calls are published solely as a journal supplementary table, which is not reachable from this sandbox. Immune subtype is therefore NOT provided."
